---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Layanan Bimbingan | Cosmo Education">
<main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)]"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- HERO BANNER SECTION -->
<section class="relative w-full bg-primary overflow-hidden text-on-primary py-20 lg:py-28">
<div class="absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 -left-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-tertiary-container/30 blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high/20 backdrop-blur-md w-fit">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">stars</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary-fixed">Official Mentorship &amp; Admissions Suite</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg leading-tight tracking-tight text-surface">
            Pendampingan Komprehensif <span class="text-secondary-fixed-dim">End-to-End</span> Menuju Universitas Impian Dunia
          </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-container-high max-w-2xl">
            Solusi bimbingan terintegrasi dengan metodologi presisi tinggi: mulai dari evaluasi profil akademik, persiapan tes bahasa bersertifikat, personal statement 1-on-1, kurasi beasiswa internasional, hingga visa pelajar tanpa kompromi.
          </p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2">
<a class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container hover:bg-secondary hover:text-on-secondary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2" href="#booking-cta">
<span>Konsultasi Profil Gratis</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
<a class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest/10 hover:bg-surface-container-lowest/20 text-surface font-label-lg text-label-lg backdrop-blur transition-all flex items-center gap-2" href="#roadmap-section">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">alt_route</span>
<span>Jelajahi 5 Tahap Bimbingan</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6 mt-2 max-w-xl">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-secondary-fixed">98.4%</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container">Tingkat Kelulusan Visa</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-surface">3.800+</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container">Alumni Global Tersebar</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-secondary-fixed">120 M+</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container">Hibah &amp; Beasiswa Diterima</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md lg:max-w-none rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-3">
<img class="w-full h-96 lg:h-[460px] object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner" data-alt="An Indonesian student engaged in an inspiring one-on-one study abroad consulting session with an experienced international admissions advisor in a modern, elegant counseling office. Sunlit architectural interior with global university banners, clean navy and warm amber accents, professional confident mood." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBsrouf4dCARUPvN77RsdvVl2BuvYJpmMpaQstknReV34Wcforj2cAcnzulxSGjE0aAv9XDNyWnUKSYLyK7ZqtJ1WBqvsQGIPrNGk5w47bn2J5pa6MsZDe3tMBuWcgZsfkle3bNVs1q1YK7bhje9GsWoP_quNoqmp-uF4qCZ4N1JD5Y4o3mqUcEDlSatdswPwL8rsUzblCWD7JnTLJrwX5v4naeSnX3D4kfe-xeNB5EKEnJMJNateEDxA"/>
<div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface p-4 rounded-xl shadow-xl hidden sm:flex items-center gap-4 max-w-xs">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">verified_user</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Akreditasi Global</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">QEAC Certified &amp; Official British Council &amp; IDP Partner</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- INTERACTIVE 5-STAGE ROADMAP JOURNEY -->
<section class="w-full py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface-bright" id="roadmap-section">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
<span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">The Cosmo Protocol</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary mt-3 mb-4">5 Tahap Pendampingan Menuju Keberangkatan</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Sistem navigasi terstruktur yang mengubah ambisi studi luar negeri menjadi rencana aksi terukur, menghapus friksi administratif, dan memaksimalkan penerimaan Anda di kampus impian.</p>
</div>
<!-- Roadmap Navigation Chips -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 lg:gap-3 mb-10" id="step-tabs">
<button class="step-btn px-5 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md transition-all shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-on-primary" data-index="0" onclick="switchStep(0)">
<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">1</span>
<span>Profiling &amp; Penjurusan</span>
</button>
<button class="step-btn px-5 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high" data-index="1" onclick="switchStep(1)">
<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">2</span>
<span>Standardized Tests</span>
</button>
<button class="step-btn px-5 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high" data-index="2" onclick="switchStep(2)">
<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">3</span>
<span>Essay &amp; CV Mentoring</span>
</button>
<button class="step-btn px-5 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high" data-index="3" onclick="switchStep(3)">
<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">4</span>
<span>Aplikasi &amp; Beasiswa</span>
</button>
<button class="step-btn px-5 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high" data-index="4" onclick="switchStep(4)">
<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">5</span>
<span>Visa &amp; Pre-Departure</span>
</button>
</div>
<!-- Roadmap Dynamic Cards (Panels) -->
<div class="relative bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden p-8 lg:p-12 transition-all">
<!-- Panel 0: Profiling -->
<div class="step-content grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center" id="step-panel-0">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-secondary-container/20 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">TAHAP PERTAMA</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">Durasi: 2 - 4 Minggu</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Profiling Akademik, Minat &amp; Penjurusan Terpadu</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Kami tidak sekadar mencocokkan nilai rapor atau IPK. Analisis komprehensif kami memetakan bakat intelektual, preferensi karier 10 tahun ke depan, kapabilitas finansial keluarga, serta probabilitas keterimaan di 5 destinasi studi terbaik dunia.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">psychology</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Holistic Skills Assessment</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Audit riwayat riset, portofolio leadership, dan non-akademik.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">query_stats</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Acceptance Rate Matrix</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Kategorisasi institusi Reach, Match, dan Safety School.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">attach_money</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Budget &amp; ROI Simulation</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Rincian proyeksi biaya kuliah, living cost, dan post-study work.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">hub</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Direct Faculty Mapping</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Pencocokan silabus spesifik, kurikulum, dan professor laboratorium.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Output Tahap 1</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">task_alt</span>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-container"></span>
                  Buku Laporan Individual "Cosmo Comprehensive Student Profiling"
                </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-container"></span>
                  Shortlist 6-8 Universitas Terakreditasi dengan tenggat pendaftaran
                </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-container"></span>
                  Personalized Master Roadmap 12 Bulan ke depan
                </li>
</ul>
<div class="pt-4 mt-2">
<a class="w-full block text-center py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors" href="#booking-cta">Jadwalkan Sesi Profiling</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Panel 1: Standardized Tests -->
<div class="step-content hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center" id="step-panel-1">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-secondary-container/20 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">TAHAP KEDUA</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">Durasi: 8 - 16 Minggu</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Standardized Test Preparation Intensif</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Mendapatkan skor tes bahasa dan bakat skolastik yang kompetitif adalah kunci membuka gerbang beasiswa dan universitas papan atas dunia. Program kami didesain berbasis diagnostik akurat dan instruktur bersertifikasi internasional.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">school</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">IELTS &amp; TOEFL iBT Masterclass</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Pelatihan terfokus 4 pilar (Writing, Speaking, Reading, Listening). Target Band 7.5+.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">calculate</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">PTE, SAT &amp; GRE Prep</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Taktik pemecahan soal analitis, kuantitatif, dan logika verbal.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">timer</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Computer-Delivered Mock Tests</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Simulasi ujian berkala dengan kondisi real exam dan umpan balik analitik.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">spellcheck</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Speaking Drill 1-on-1</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Latihan kelancaran dan vokabulari akademis bersama native/near-native speakers.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Target Skor Garansi</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">trending_up</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary mb-1">
<span>Target Rata-rata Siswa IELTS</span>
<span>7.5 Band Score</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-high h-2.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-secondary-container h-full rounded-full" style="width: 88%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary mb-1">
<span>Target TOEFL iBT</span>
<span>105+ Points</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-high h-2.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-primary h-full rounded-full" style="width: 92%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 mt-2">
<a class="w-full block text-center py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors" href="#booking-cta">Ambil Diagnostic Test Gratis</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Panel 2: Essay & SOP -->
<div class="step-content hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center" id="step-panel-2">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-secondary-container/20 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">TAHAP KETIGA</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">Durasi: 4 - 8 Minggu</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Essay, Statement of Purpose &amp; CV Mentoring</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Komite penerimaan kampus dunia membaca ribuan esai dengan kualifikasi setara. Kami membantu Anda merangkai narasi personal otentik, menyoroti ketangguhan karakter intelektual, dan menyusun CV akademis berstandar Oxford dan Harvard.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">edit_note</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Ideation &amp; Storycrafting</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Menggali sudut pandang unik melalui bimbingan brainstorming mendalam.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">person_outline</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Alumni 1-on-1 Review</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Review redaksional berlapis dari mentor lulusan universitas target.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">badge</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Academic CV Optimization</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Format ATS-friendly dengan penekanan pada dampak dan hasil terukur.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">mail</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Letter of Recommendation Guide</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Panduan penulisan referensi bagi dosen pembimbing atau atasan profesional.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Standar Review Berkualitas</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">verified</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Maksimal 5x putaran revisi substantif tanpa batas pengecekan grammar dan etika orisinalitas (zero plagiarism policy).</p>
<div class="p-3 bg-surface-container rounded-lg font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">format_quote</span>
<span class="italic">"Esai saya bertransformasi dari sekadar daftar prestasi menjadi cerita visi hidup yang meyakinkan UC Berkeley."</span>
</div>
<div class="pt-2">
<a class="w-full block text-center py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors" href="#booking-cta">Konsultasikan Draft Anda</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Panel 3: University Application -->
<div class="step-content hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center" id="step-panel-3">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-secondary-container/20 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">TAHAP KEEMPAT</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">Durasi: 3 - 6 Minggu</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Aplikasi Universitas &amp; Strategi Beasiswa Global</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Sebagai mitra resmi terdaftar universitas terkemuka dunia, Cosmo Education memfasilitasi jalur aplikasi langsung melalui UCAS, Common App, atau portal terintegrasi mitra, lengkap dengan strategi beasiswa prestasi parsial maupun penuh.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">folder_shared</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Direct Portal Submission</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Pengisian berkas tanpa celah pada portal universitas dan sistem sentral.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">military_tech</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Curated Scholarship Matching</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Pencocokan skema LPDP, Chevening, AAS, Fulbright, dan beasiswa internal kampus.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">translate</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Sworn Translation &amp; Notary</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Layanan legalisasi dan penerjemah tersumpah untuk ijazah dan transkrip.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5">support_agent</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Direct Admissions Follow-Up</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Komunikasi intensif dengan admission officer untuk konfirmasi Letter of Acceptance.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Jaminan Pengawasan</span>
